[h1]English[/h1]
[b]Unofficial compatibility patch: Pen's Pipette × Vanilla Chemistry Expansion[/b]

[list]
[*][b]One-drag ratio balancing (18 rules)[/b]: fill the auto-pipette with a reagent and drag it onto the target once; it tops the reagent up to the recipe's stoichiometric ratio and does nothing when already balanced. The reaction itself is still done by Vanilla Chemistry Expansion's own per-second/night tick.
[*][b]Nuclear barrel guard[/b]: radioactive liquids can no longer be sucked out of an opened nuclear waste barrel with the pipette; pouring reagents in still works.
[*]Requires (subscribe manually): [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3829409725]Pen's Pipette[/url] and [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3832077837]Vanilla Chemistry Expansion[/url].
[*]Game 1.0.0.16; Pipette 1.1.5; Vanilla Chem Ext 1.11.1. Source & docs: [url=https://github.com/xiaolanyuyi/pipette-vce-compat]GitHub[/url].
[/list]
